references and group rolls. Sell All keeps bags and casting supplies; bank valuable gear before selling.</p><a href=\"advanced-loot.html\">Learn the loot interface →</a></div></section><section class=\"feature-row\"><h3>One launcher, current updates</h3><div><p>The normal Nightcap shortcut delivers managed game/interface updates and dated patch summaries. Keep your existing folder and personal settings.</p><a href=\"launcher.html\">Update before playing →</a></div></section></div><h2 id=\"updates\">Keep up with changes</h2><p>Read <a href=\"recent-changes.html\">Recent changes</a> for dated updates. Each release review covers affected guides, commands, item and zone pages, and this Features overview together.</p><p class=\"notice\"><strong>Live testing:</strong> <a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\">Raid and Grind dungeon modes</a> are available from all seven entrance Keepers. Existing legacy runs keep their original behavior until expiry or reset. Gameplay and balance acceptance remain open.</p>",
