-  "body": "<div class=\"welcome\"><div class=\"welcome-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A familiar world. Your own path.</p><h2>Three classes.<br>One more adventure.</h2><p>Find your build, learn the custom systems, and discover what is waiting beyond the tunnel.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"getting-started.html\">Start your journey →</a></div><img src=\"assets/traders-at-dusk.png\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" alt=\"Nightcap traders beneath lanterns in a stone tunnel at dusk.\"></div><div class=\"facts\"><span><strong>Classic</strong> current era</span><span><strong>50</strong> level cap</span><span><strong>3</strong> classes per character</span><span><strong>48</strong> reward zones</span></div><p class=\"feature-entry\"><strong>New to Nightcap?</strong> <a href=\"features.html\">Explore Features — the major changes from Classic →</a></p><div class=\"portal-grid\"><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Character & classes</h2><ul><li><a href=\"multiclass.html\">Multiclass & progression</a><small>Choose your classes, skills and abilities.</small></li><li><a href=\"pets.html\">Pets & pet armor</a><small>Your companions, commands and loadouts.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Items & equipment</h2><ul><li><a href=\"items.html\">Browse equipment</a><small>Find gear and augments by slot, level and zone.</small></li><li><a href=\"zone-hunt.html\">Zone hunt & forging</a><small>Drop chances, heroic augments and upgrades.</small></li><li><a href=\"equipment.html\">Equipment & trading</a><small>Existing tiers, bags and selling rules.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Explore the world</h2><ul><li><a href=\"zones.html\">Zones & rewards</a><small>48 Classic destinations and their rewards.</small></li><li><a href=\"tunnel.html\">East Commonlands tunnel</a><small>Trainers, merchants and blessings.</small></li><li><a href=\"travel.html\">Travel & instances</a><small>Find your way out. Find your way home.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Adventures & quests</h2><ul><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html\">Advanced loot</a><small>Personal drops, filters and group rolls.</small></li><li><a href=\"ascension.html\">Ascension quest</a><small>Reforge your original class epic.</small></li><li><a href=\"waypoints.html\">Waypoint Explorer</a><small>Discover destinations and earn a title.</small></li></ul></section></div><div class=\"home-columns\"><section><h2>New in Nightcap</h2><p><a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\"><strong>Raid or Grind in seven private dungeons.</strong></a> Complete personal boss checklists for new rewards, with exclusive Raid drops. Available for live testing.</p><p><strong>Build, craft and upgrade.</strong> Early spell scribing, stacked tradeskills and Craft All, reusable item upgrades, and equipment for your held classes are live.</p><p>Passive AA is now <strong>20%</strong> alongside normal leveling. <a href=\"recent-changes.html\">Read the latest changes →</a></p></section><section><h2>At the campfire</h2><ul><li><a href=\"commands.html\">Keep the command reference handy</a></li><li><a href=\"launcher.html\">Update your launcher and game</a></li><li><a href=\"combat.html\">Read about combat and recovery</a></li><li><a href=\"unreleased.html\">See what is still in development</a></li></ul><p class=\"notice\">Nightcap is in live testing. Feature labels distinguish installed systems from unreleased work.</p></section></div>",
+  "body": "<div class=\"welcome\"><div class=\"welcome-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A familiar world. Your own path.</p><h2>Three classes.<br>One more adventure.</h2><p>Find your build, learn the custom systems, and discover what is waiting beyond the tunnel.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"getting-started.html\">Start your journey →</a></div><img src=\"assets/traders-at-dusk.png\" width=\"1672\" height=\"941\" alt=\"Nightcap traders beneath lanterns in a stone tunnel at dusk.\"></div><div class=\"facts\"><span><strong>Classic</strong> current era</span><span><strong>50</strong> level cap</span><span><strong>3</strong> classes per character</span><span><strong>48</strong> reward zones</span></div><p class=\"feature-entry\"><strong>New to Nightcap?</strong> <a href=\"features.html\">Explore Features — the major changes from Classic →</a></p><div class=\"portal-grid\"><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Character & classes</h2><ul><li><a href=\"multiclass.html\">Multiclass & progression</a><small>Choose your classes, skills and abilities.</small></li><li><a href=\"pets.html\">Pets & pet armor</a><small>Your companions, commands and loadouts.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Items & equipment</h2><ul><li><a href=\"items.html\">Browse equipment</a><small>Find gear and augments by slot, level and zone.</small></li><li><a href=\"zone-hunt.html\">Zone hunt & forging</a><small>Drop chances, heroic augments and upgrades.</small></li><li><a href=\"equipment.html\">Equipment & trading</a><small>Existing tiers, bags and selling rules.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Explore the world</h2><ul><li><a href=\"zones.html\">Zones & rewards</a><small>48 Classic destinations and their rewards.</small></li><li><a href=\"tunnel.html\">East Commonlands tunnel</a><small>Trainers, merchants and blessings.</small></li><li><a href=\"travel.html\">Travel & instances</a><small>Find your way out. Find your way home.</small></li></ul></section><section class=\"portal\"><h2>Adventures & quests</h2><ul><li><a href=\"advanced-loot.html\">Advanced loot</a><small>Personal drops, filters and group rolls.</small></li><li><a href=\"ascension.html\">Ascension quest</a><small>Reforge your original class epic.</small></li><li><a href=\"waypoints.html\">Waypoint Explorer</a><small>Discover destinations and earn a title.</small></li></ul></section></div><div class=\"home-columns\"><section><h2>New in Nightcap</h2><p><a href=\"dungeon-modes.html\"><strong>Raid or Grind in seven private dungeons.</strong></a> Complete personal boss checklists for new rewards, with exclusive Raid drops. Available for live testing.</p><p><strong>Build, craft and upgrade.</strong> Early spell scribing, stacked tradeskills and Craft All, reusable item upgrades, and equipment for your held classes are live. The <a href=\"item-upgrades.html#normal-items\">normal-item box recipe</a> is awaiting release.</p><p>Passive AA is now <strong>20%</strong> alongside normal leveling. <a href=\"recent-changes.html\">Read the latest changes →</a></p></section><section><h2>At the campfire</h2><ul><li><a href=\"commands.html\">Keep the command reference handy</a></li><li><a href=\"launcher.html\">Update your launcher and game</a></li><li><a href=\"combat.html\">Read about combat and recovery</a></li><li><a href=\"unreleased.html\">See what is still in development</a></li></ul><p class=\"notice\">Nightcap is in live testing. Feature labels distinguish installed systems from unreleased work.</p></section></div>",
